MERGE (d:Document {source: 'YouTube:Delay+ device – New in Bitwig Studio 4.3#0', content: '**Bitwig Tutorial: Delay+ device – New in Bitwig Studio 4.3** Delay+ is Bitwig\'s newest audio effect. By combining classic delay options, easy routing patterns, and an open feedback loop with some character options Delay+ is ready for service as your go to delay. Let\'s take a look. The delay time can be set in time or in beats Along with a clickable slider for triplets, dots, or times in between. ', doc_type: 'youtube_transcript', video_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U2Hx4UklbaY', chunk_index: 0});
