MERGE (d:Document {source: 'YouTube:Getting Started: Bitwig Studio\'s Arranger and Clip Launcher#2', content: '**Bitwig Tutorial: Getting Started: Bitwig Studio\'s Arranger and Clip Launcher** the end And I might also want to introduce or place a couple more sounds into the mixture here So maybe I want to put a crash at the very beginning And maybe I want to put a white noise sweep leading into the next section And now what I can do is use the pen tool to kind of fill in the blanks here And then highlight a', doc_type: 'youtube_transcript', video_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vx20E5qvW6A', chunk_index: 2});
