MERGE (d:Document {source: 'YouTube:How To Use Bitwig\'s Loud Split Device#0', content: '**Bitwig Tutorial: How To Use Bitwig\'s Loud Split Device** Let\'s take a look at Loud Split, one of Bitwig Studio\'s spectral devices. Now, most audio processors look at signal the way our audio files look The way the microphone hears pressure changes over time or the voltage going to the speakers recreates that up and down movement of signal It\'s treating the entire signal as a whole that is just b', doc_type: 'youtube_transcript', video_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dUw1-QpKmBw', chunk_index: 0});
