MERGE (d:Document {source: 'YouTube:Modern Workflows, New Possibilities: An Introduction to Bitwig Studio#0', content: '**Bitwig Tutorial: Modern Workflows, New Possibilities: An Introduction to Bitwig Studio** Greetings from Berlin. I\'m Dave from Bitwig. While we would prefer to be in California weather with everybody else, we are honored to be here in this format. I just want to show you a little bit of Bitwig Studio today and what makes it unique and a truly powerful modern DAW and sound design library. So. Bitw', doc_type: 'youtube_transcript', video_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=11aNC1e6r9c', chunk_index: 0});
