MERGE (d:Document {source: 'YouTube:Modular Concepts: Perspectives on Pitch [Bitwig Studio | The Grid]#0', content: '**Bitwig Tutorial: Modular Concepts: Perspectives on Pitch [Bitwig Studio | The Grid]** Hello, and welcome to Bitwig, featuring The Grid. Today\'s modular concept is pitch. If we were to look in the dictionary, pitch is defined as something like the highness or lowness of sound. Which, if we look at a piano keyboard we kind of understand. But it is a very vague definition, like most perceptual thin', doc_type: 'youtube_transcript', video_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c9KRGX2PDLM', chunk_index: 0});
