MERGE (d:Document {source: 'YouTube:Modular Concepts: Phase, a Matter of Timing [Bitwig Studio | The Grid]#0', content: '**Bitwig Tutorial: Modular Concepts: Phase, a Matter of Timing [Bitwig Studio | The Grid]** Hello, and welcome back to Bitwig, featuring The Grid. Today\'s modular concept is phase. Here in this patch, we\'re looking at the three typical descriptors of sound: pitch, timbre, and loudness, with each of them moving over time, which in most sound design is what makes things interesting — that sense of m', doc_type: 'youtube_transcript', video_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rIGcOpf59_g', chunk_index: 0});
