MERGE (d:Document {source: 'YouTube:Modular Concepts: Polyphony [Bitwig Studio]#0', content: '**Bitwig Tutorial: Modular Concepts: Polyphony [Bitwig Studio]** Hello and welcome back to Bitwig. Today\'s Modular Concept is polyphony. Now, we often think of polyphony in pretty limited terms as in whether we can play multiple notes at a time or not. Now, that isn\'t incorrect — in a technology term, if I request more notes, I can definitely hear these notes being held out. But it isn\'t just the ', doc_type: 'youtube_transcript', video_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=918bVhni7xU', chunk_index: 0});
